A W 0~
wem m40502~
the wem~
A Wem growls in your direction.
~
   Wem's resemble twisted humans, their pale bodies gnarled and knotted like
tree trunks in a graveyard.  Instead of a mouth or eyes, huge gaping black
holes ooze from their faces where they should be.  Although they appear blind,
since they have holes instead of eyes, they can see perfectly fine.  No one
knows how or why, but they do.  Some say magic, others say they can "smell"
your location.  There hands are huge copper claws, like those of a gorgon's, or
of a Furies.    
~
